    objectSwimwearTitle: { en: "Duoduo Swimwear", zh: "", ko: "두두 수영복", ja: "多多水着", es: "Duoduo Swimwear", fr: "Duoduo Maillot" },
    objectSwimwearStatus: { en: "TESTING ·", zh: "测试中", ko: "테스트 중 ·", ja: "テスト中 ·", es: "EN PRUEBA ·", fr: "EN TEST ·" },
    objectSwimwearCopy: { en: "Starting from a real small experiment in Sri Lanka: put sea, nomadic details and body expression into swimwear, then advance to samples and the local market.", zh: "从斯里兰卡的一次真实小实验开始：把海、游牧细节和身体表达放进泳衣，再推进到样品与当地市场。", ko: "스리랑카의 진짜 작은 실험에서 시작: 바다, 유목 세부, 신체 표현을 수영복에 담고 샘플과 현지 시장으로 나아간다。", ja: "スリランカの本物の小実験から: 海、遊牧の細部、身体表現を水着に込め、サンプルと現地市場へ。", es: "Desde un pequeño experimento real en Sri Lanka: meter mar, detalles nómadas y expresión corporal en la ropa de baño, y avanzar a muestras y mercado local.", fr: "À partir d’une petite expérience réelle au Sri Lanka : mettre mer, détails nomades et expression corporelle dans le maillot, puis avancer vers échantillons et marché local." },
    objectSwimwearItem1: { en: "First batch of samples", zh: "第一批样品", ko: "첫 샘플 배치", ja: "最初のサンプル", es: "Primer lote de muestras", fr: "Premier lot d’échantillons" },
